# SPA fallback for static hosting (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages).
#
# Without this, a direct navigation or a browser refresh on any route other
# than "/" — /dashboard, /reports/CS-2026-ABC123, /account — 404s: the host
# looks for a real file at that path, and this is a client-side-routed React
# app with no such file. Every unmatched path falls through to index.html
# instead, and react-router takes it from there.
#
# Copied to dist/_redirects unchanged by Vite (anything under public/ is).
/*   /index.html   200
